{"id":"3cca93ccf127333f","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-recursive-function.md","title":"Recursive Function","display":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-recursive-function","aliases":["57-df-recursive-function"],"display":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function","depends_on":["[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-recursive-function]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-recursive-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-recursive-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8105afc544202519\" href=\"?note=8105afc544202519\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function\">90-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}\">\\(\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}\\)</span> 分别指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Partial}\">\\(\\mathrm{Partial}\\)</span> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8105afc544202519\" href=\"?note=8105afc544202519\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function\">90-df-recursive-function</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span>。上标仅消除跨册同名混淆，不是新谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\)</span> 保持本册原本的<strong>部分递归</strong>含义，不改成 90 的总递归谓词。原始递归子类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}(f)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}(f)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原式把自然数序列分量当作函数，再混用函数投影和程序码，且投影含第零个变量。这里通过原已依赖的第 90 册部分递归接口明确同一函数类；不把 Rec 名字相同误认为两册全性约定相同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"8105afc544202519","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 为函数图；$\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}$ 与 $\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}$ 分别指 [[90-df-partial-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{Partial}$ 和 [[90-df-recursive-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{PartRec}$。上标仅消除跨册同名混淆，不是新谓词。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 保持本册原本的**部分递归**含义，不改成 90 的总递归谓词。原始递归子类见 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"8105afc544202519","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 为函数图；$\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}$ 与 $\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}$ 分别指 [[90-df-partial-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{Partial}$ 和 [[90-df-recursive-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{PartRec}$。上标仅消除跨册同名混淆，不是新谓词。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 保持本册原本的**部分递归**含义，不改成 90 的总递归谓词。原始递归子类见 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 为函数图；$\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}$ 与 $\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}$ 分别指 [[90-df-partial-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{Partial}$ 和 [[90-df-recursive-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{PartRec}$。上标仅消除跨册同名混淆，不是新谓词。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 保持本册原本的**部分递归**含义，不改成 90 的总递归谓词。原始递归子类见 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Partial}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}(f)].","display":true}],"bytes":1262,"backlinks":[{"id":"ffb90a5e7b76ea84","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本文件使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的一元数值层级及 $\\chi_A$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 是 [[57-df-recursive-function]] 的部分递归函数谓词；$A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}$ 是下述本地集合类重载，不把函数和自然数集混为一类。"},{"id":"d6a5ff61521a8f18","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$、$r\\geq1$、$k\\in\\mathbb N$；关系 $A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r$ 以其特征函数 $\\chi_A$ 表示。$\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A)$ 见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]；$\\chi_A$ 本身是总函数，因此这里表达可判定性。自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。本文件的层级作用于**数值关系**，不与另一个文件的原始语法公式集合混同；$\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0$ 是一元实例的原接口，额外下标 r 仅用于明示投影元数。"},{"id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"额外的有效性接口使用一个固定的有限串编码 $\\operatorname{str}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N$：$\\pi(a,b)=2^a(2b+1)-1$，$\\operatorname{str}(\\varepsilon)=0$，$\\operatorname{str}(a^\\frown s)=\\pi(a,\\operatorname{str}(s))+1$。固定单射 $b:L\\to\\mathbb N$，其像、各符号分区的像和元数函数的图可判定；变量按既有枚举 $V(i)$ 编码。$\\operatorname{tok}(e)$ 是表达式 $e$ 的完全括号化前缀串，递归式如下；$\\frown$ 为串连接。$\\mathrm{Rec}(h)$ 对函数使用 [[57-df-recursive-function]] 的接口，下面同时要求 $h,d$ 为总函数。"},{"id":"a27c6e4aaf7a32c7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$g:\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N$ 为总函数；$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n$。递归性见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]；以下定义本身只用 $g$ 的全定义性。"},{"id":"43ca2d9b7fc5df00","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"68e2d5e250a907ad","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 为部分函数。输入和输出固定为 [[88-df-encoding]] 的 $\\operatorname{wordenc}$ 数值元组表示。$\\mathrm{Effective}(f)$ 取 [[90-df-effective-procedure]] 的形式化、相对表示的谓词，不指尚未形式化的经验概念；$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。本文件的 $\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}$ 是下式给出的同表示机器可计算性接口。"},{"id":"4c97a440c08bba55","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"97ed617d0dc0e7f2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是总递归函数：$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。$\\varphi_e$ 固定为 [[57-df-phi-e]] 的可接受程序编号的一元部分函数图；不能替换为任意无有效参数化性质的枚举。"},{"id":"9189845d6da5bd4f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k$，$\\chi_R$ 是取值为 $0,1$ 的总特征函数。$\\mathrm{Recursive}(R)$ 在本文件表示 $\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_R)$，见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。$\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)$ 互异；$\\vdash$ 是 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶关系。$\\mathrm{Representable}(R,T)$ 是 [[57-df-representable]] 的 $\\mathrm{Rep}_T(R)$ 的兼容写法；$Q$ 见 [[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。"},{"id":"618553e8457e6561","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是总递归函数：$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。$\\varphi_e$ 固定为 [[57-df-phi-e]] 的可接受程序编号的一元部分函数图；不能替换为任意无有效参数化性质的枚举。"},{"id":"14f0accd0b75a0b1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-d